      "text": "The resistance of the Ammeter will be  <math><mn>0.02</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>  (round off to  <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math>  decimal place)",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "js5Sl",
      "text": "If the ideal cell is replaced by a cell having internal resistance of  <math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>  then the measured value of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>  will be more than  <math><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
